      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like a \"mistake\" though. mistakes are things you trip over or forget. this was... it was just me being a bad person. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who shouldn't be allowed to have a life. how can you say i belong here when i know what i'm capable of? i just feel like the world would be cleaner without my mess in it.",
