    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just what people say to make themselves feel better. it's a lie. if i were actually a good person, i wouldn't even feel this way. i'd just be good. the fact that i'm this broken just proves there's no \"healing\" to be done. it's like there's just no point in trying to fix something that's fundamentally rotten at the core. it feels like the only logical way to stop the damage is to just... stop existing. do you actually believe that people this far gone can ever be okay again?",
